      "assistant_text": "According to the [[credential-scoping]] page, the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, a secrets loader reads the key from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file at startup and injects it into the environment variables of the Ingest agent child process immediately before that process starts. \n\nThe key point is that the Hub\u0027s own process environment never holds the key; it exists only within the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API. The same pattern applies to the Query agent \u2014 it also receives the credential injected into its own environment at spawn time, never inherited from or written into the Hub\u0027s process environment.",
